Z||000006||tgowens||11-03-2000||07:29 PM||||one is an automatic (I was going to build it into a show car for myself - the interior is perfect and the engine only has 10,000 miles on it. It does need some work though, paint in spots and taillight lenses as well as tires. I was going to replace the shocks and struts and generally fix it right. Oh, it needs a right front fender but we have them here.......generally speaking, the car can be restored here and in excellent condition. It has all options except rear window defrost and the factory performance sound system (but, we have those in stock here too).<P>As for a trade, I'm sure something could be worked out but I would suggest that you call George at the shop as this is a car that the shop bought and he knows the history better than I do. 1-510-233-4376<P>------------------<BR>                <IMG SRC="http://www.tgowens.com/tgowens_sig.gif">                            <BR><A HREF="http://www.tgowens.com/fiero" TARGET=_blank>www.tgowens.com/fiero</A> - Blue '87 GT - Gold '87 GT<BR><A HREF="http://www.cfog.org" TARGET=_blank>www.cfog.org</A> - Classic Fiero Owners Group<BR><A HREF="http://www.http://www.fieroshop.net/" TARGET=_blank>www.http://www.fieroshop.net/</A> - Fiero Shop - Richmond, CA - 1-510-23-FIERO||||reg||1
Z||000007||Ozzy||11-03-2000||10:53 PM||||Hey Tg...I'm still workin' my way out to you folks...Too much stuff goin' on. At least I'm outta the Hospital now!<P>Hey Fiero5? I can't believe you did not find a Blue GT out closer to you yet. I have a Blue '87...we spoke last time and I kinda lost contact because I could not access the e-mail associated with the forum for several weeks.<P>If you were to sell the Maroon GT outright, how much would you ask for it??<P>Mine is a stick and needs some minor work; To be honest, I like the blue original but I like the Maroon as well. I'm only really interested if I end up with a better quality car than I already have for no extra cost.<P>Not trying to be a hardass; Just being honest with you upfront is all.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><BR>Ozzy<P>------------------<BR>There are 3 types of people in this world;<P><I>Those who make things happen,<BR>Those who watch things happen,<BR>And those who wonder <B>What Da hell Happened?!</B></I> <P>    <B><I>Ozzy</I></B>  <BR>'87 GT (Ol' Blue)||||reg||5
Z||000008||Fiero5||11-03-2000||11:16 PM||||"Why not just paint it?"<P>He allready thought of that, and the quotes he was getting to have it really done right was more than if he just went out and purchased a nice blue GT outright. Since he doesn't want two GT's, he then thought of trading instead. <BR>He wouldn't mind selling his outright, as long as he isn't without a Fiero for too long (a blue one of course) :-)||||reg||1
